4. Audit, Compliance, Disaster Recovery, & Privacy
	Audit & Compliance: Compliance with international standards (ISO 27001, GDPR, HIPAA) enforced through third-party audits, granular system logs, and explicit Service Level Agreements (SLAs)9.
	Cloud Disaster Recovery: Replaces traditional manual backups with Backup as a Service (BaaS) and Disaster Recovery as a Service (DRaaS)927. Utilizes multi-zone data replication and virtualization-based hardware independence to minimize Recovery Time Objectives (RTO)9more_horiz.
	Privacy & Data Integrity: Digital signatures, automated data lifecycle policies, and regular integrity checks prevent unauthorized tampering during cross-border data movements9more_horiz.
